<title>USA: Multimedia Games registers share sale.</title>
<headline>Multimedia Games registers share sale.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Multimedia Games Inc said Thursday it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission on June 3 for the sale of about 135,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The shares are held by 11 shareholders who recently exercised warrants they obtained in two private placements in 1993 and 1994, said company chief financial officer Fred Roll.</p>
<p>The registration &quot;doesn't mean they're selling, it just enables them to do so,&quot; Roll said.</p>
<p>He added the exercise prices of the warrants ranged from $2.50 to $6.00.</p>
</text>
